{* Create Project — quick tips + status guide (sidebar) *}
{strip}
<aside class="mk-proj-aside" aria-label="Guidance">
	<div class="mk-proj-aside-card mk-proj-aside-card--tips">
		<div class="mk-proj-aside-card__head">
			<span class="mk-proj-aside-card__icon mk-proj-aside-card__icon--tips" aria-hidden="true">
				<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 1 7 7c0 2.4-1.2 4.5-3 5.7V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.3C6.2 13.5 5 11.4 5 9a7 7 0 0 1 7-7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M9 21h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
			</span>
			<h3 class="mk-proj-aside-card__title">Quick tips</h3>
		</div>
		<div class="mk-proj-aside-card__body">
			<p class="mk-proj-aside-card__text">
				Chọn <strong>Start Date</strong> và <strong>End Date</strong> rõ ràng — giúp lịch và báo cáo tiến độ chính xác.
			</p>
			<p class="mk-proj-aside-card__text mk-proj-aside-card__text--muted">
				<strong>Assigned To</strong> có thể là người dùng hoặc nhóm team. Liên kết <strong>Opportunity</strong> / <strong>Organization</strong> nếu dự án gắn với bán hàng.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="mk-proj-aside-card mk-proj-aside-card--stages">
		<div class="mk-proj-aside-card__head">
			<span class="mk-proj-aside-card__icon mk-proj-aside-card__icon--stages" aria-hidden="true">
				<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 18h16M6 12h12M8 6h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
			</span>
			<h3 class="mk-proj-aside-card__title">Status guide</h3>
		</div>
		<ul class="mk-proj-stage-guide">
			<li class="mk-proj-stage-guide__item mk-proj-stage-guide__item--early">
				<span class="mk-proj-stage-guide__badge">Open</span>
				<span class="mk-proj-stage-guide__hint">In Progress · đang triển khai</span>
			</li>
			<li class="mk-proj-stage-guide__item mk-proj-stage-guide__item--mid">
				<span class="mk-proj-stage-guide__badge">Hold</span>
				<span class="mk-proj-stage-guide__hint">On Hold · tạm dừng</span>
			</li>
			<li class="mk-proj-stage-guide__item mk-proj-stage-guide__item--won">
				<span class="mk-proj-stage-guide__badge">Done</span>
				<span class="mk-proj-stage-guide__hint">Completed · đã hoàn tất</span>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</aside>
{/strip}
